#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0664 expect=violation domain=ADNCA
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when, on a record in an ADNCA v1.0 dataset, COHORT is populated and COHORTN is present but not populated.
#note "COHORT populated and COHORTN present but empty -> violation. Scoped to BDS/ADNCA; prior fixture used ADLBC (out of scope) and omitted COHORTN."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADNCA class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col COHORT type=Char
col COHORTN type=Num
col PARAMCD type=Char
col NFRLT type=Num
col AFRLT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Cohort 1 | | CONC | 0 | 0.5
---
